<div class="wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile" style="grid-template-columns:32% auto"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><a href="https://www.reelshort.com/fandom/zachary-rist-01-6-3faa2218/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" src="https://www.reelshort.com/fandom/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/zachary-rist.jpg" alt="Zachary Rist" class="wp-image-36864 size-full" srcset="https://www.reelshort.com/fandom/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/zachary-rist.jpg 600w, https://www.reelshort.com/fandom/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/zachary-rist-300x200.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" /></a></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><a href="https://www.reelshort.com/fandom/zachary-rist-01-6-3faa2218/">Zachary Rist</a></h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Knowing Zachary Rist is loving him. Zach&#8217;s a vibe, a walking talent, a lovely son, and a complete fun package. He has also worked with many organizations that realized how outstanding he is. He’s one of the kings in the vertical world.</p>
</div></div>



